              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">98027366-cb0f-4070-a366-fe9d863df4a1</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">02 | Portale / m / kN</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Due parti indipendenti confluiscono in Merge Straus Models con Renumber=true.
Portale 6 x 3 m, S355, profilo I parametrico, incastri alla base.
G=-5 e Q=-3 kN/m sulla trave. Due combinazioni dimostrative.
Run=false: puoi esplorare il Model e la preview senza Straus7.
La zona Analisi mostra il percorso per ottenere lo stesso Model con risultati.</item>
                  </items>
